{
  "about": "Cases of storm_ui_pack_check (tools/pack_check.cpp): the real UI pack drawn with the real screen and HUD adapters. Every models/*.json that is an interface model and is not used below is a case of its own. A case feeds `states` (channel=file, in order) and then its `interface`, then `answer` (the model the game answers a request of the opened screen with: a shop asks for its selected row's deal); `covers` names the screens it draws that its interface does not (channel screens). `taps` = element ids tapped (a real touch on the drawn element, in order) after all that: a HUD state that a tap opens (the abilities list, the raised spyglass). Every ported screen (screens/registry.cpp) must be covered by a case or listed in `uncovered` with the reason.",
